(| Tool | Purpose | Required arguments | Additional scope |) Tj
T*
(| --- | --- | --- | --- |) Tj
T*
(| `get_release_status` | Returns release readiness and approvers | `component`,) Tj
T*
(  `version` | none |) Tj
T*
(| `get_dependencies` | Returns component dependencies | `component`, `version` | none |) Tj
T*
(| `check_security_vulnerabilities` | Returns demo vulnerability findings | `component`,) Tj
T*
(  `version` | none |) Tj
T*
(| `approve_release` | Approves a release and returns an approval ticket | `component`,) Tj
T*
(  `version` | `mcp:tools:release` |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Auth Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(Client) Tj
T*
(  |) Tj
T*
(  | POST /auth/token { clientId, scopes, clientSecret? }) Tj
T*
(  v) Tj
T*
(SecureMcpServer) Tj
T*
(  |) Tj
T*
(  | validate requested scopes) Tj
T*
(  | require demo-release-secret for mcp:tools:release) Tj
T*
(  v) Tj
T*
(JWT access token) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Client) Tj
T*
(  |) Tj
T*
(  | Authorization: Bearer <token>) Tj
T*
(  | POST /mcp/messages tools/call) Tj
T*
(  v) Tj
T*
(SecureMcpServer) Tj
T*
(  |) Tj
T*
(  | validate JWT) Tj
T*
(  | require mcp:tools) Tj
T*
(  | require mcp:tools:release for approve_release) Tj
T*
(  | audit call) Tj
T*
(  v) Tj
T*
(JSON-RPC result or JSON-RPC error) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Negative paths:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- missing or invalid token returns 401) Tj
T*
(- valid token without `mcp:tools` returns 403) Tj
T*
(- `approve_release` without `mcp:tools:release` returns 403) Tj
T*
(- privileged token issuance without the demo release secret returns 403) Tj
T*
(- unknown scopes return 400) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data Flow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`ReleaseDataService` loads `demo-data.json` from the server output directory. If the) Tj
T*
(  file is not present, it falls back to an embedded default payload so the demo remains) Tj
T*
(  runnable during local experiments.) Tj
ET
