T*
(Testing Strategy) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The server tests use `WebApplicationFactory<Program>` to exercise the actual ASP.NET) Tj
T*
(  Core pipeline. Coverage includes token issuance constraints, release-scope) Tj
T*
(  authorization, tool discovery consistency, and demo data responses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The client tests cover the rule-based planner's known and fallback parsing paths.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Run:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(dotnet test --configuration Release) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Production Hardening) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For real deployment:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Replace `/auth/token` with OAuth2/OIDC through a trusted provider.) Tj
T*
(2. Replace symmetric demo signing with RSA or ECDSA and key rotation.) Tj
T*
(3. Store secrets in a managed secret store.) Tj
T*
(4. Add rate limiting, request-size limits, and stricter JSON-RPC validation.) Tj
T*
(5. Store audit logs in a tamper-resistant sink.) Tj
T*
(6. Add end-to-end tests for the intended MCP transport and client behavior.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This architecture document is for educational and demonstration purposes only.) Tj
ET
